  m_text: "This is your Base Camp.\nBeyond the door lies an abandoned spaceship.\nFind
    ore, sell it here\nand earn enough gold to escape!\n\n- Press the button on the
    right of the door to open / close it.\n- Throw ore into the Sell Cube on the
    left of the door to sell it.\n- If a teammate goes down, buy a Revive Syringe
    and throw it at them.\n- Press the Escape button in front of the Team Status
    wall to end the game.\n  Downed teammates will be left behind!\n- Your team's
    gold will be recorded on the ranking board."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22966ed4b2accbc6dd46dc36d222d833, type: 2}
